title = "Watch Mods and Colors"
message = "Roll once more and inspect the dice. The Painted Die mod adds a random unlocked color to the dice. Other colors can add score, multiply, grant Coupons, or add extra rolls to your next turn.

Five dice of one color double that color's effect. Five or more distinct colors boost Green, Red, Purple, and Blue effects by 50 percent."
